      text Government benefits
    h1 Government benefits
    h2 Most popular
    link "Learn about food assistance programs like SNAP (food stamps)" /food-help
    link "Find out about Social Security and how to apply if you are eligible" /what-is-social-security
    link "Get help with your utility bills" /help-with-utility-bills
    text Get information on government programs that may help you pay for food, housing, health care, and other basic living expenses. Learn about Social Security and government checks.
    row
      link "Find government benefits and financial help Discover government benefits that you may be eligible for and learn how to apply." /benefit-finder
      link "Food assistance Get nutritious food through SNAP (food stamps), WIC for women, infants, and children, and emergency food assistance." /food-help
      link "Health insurance Get information about Medicaid, CHIP, Medicare, the ACA Health Insurance Marketplace, and COBRA." /health-insurance
      link "Housing help Learn about rental and buyer assistance programs. Find emergency housing and avoid eviction." /housing-help
      link "Help with utility bills Learn about government programs to help pay for phone, internet, and energy bills." /help-with-utility-bills
      link "Welfare and financial assistance Learn about welfare benefits, financial assistance, and more." /welfare-and-financial-assistance
      link "Social Security Learn about Social Security, including retirement and disability benefits, how to get or replace your Social Security card, and more." /social-security
      link "Government checks and payments Report missing government checks. Trace unexpected payments. Make a payment to the government." /government-checks-payments
      link "State social service agencies Contact your state social service agency for information about state benefit programs and more." /state-social-services
      link "Government death benefits Find government survivor benefits for housing, education, military, and more." /government-death-benefits
      link "Where to report incorrect benefit payments Get contact information for reporting missing or incorrect federal benefit payments." /report-incorrect-benefit-payments
      link "Government grants and loans Learn about federal grants for states and organizations and federal loans for individuals." /government-grants-and-loans
